name: A recorded expansion keeps its own source claims and preserves earlier history
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/trace_source_history.py seed @TMP_TARGET @ART
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 REVIEW || KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/open-trace-finding.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 FINDING · Esc then Y | selected-finding
require-live-snap: 20 Viewing Review | review-reader
nav-mode:
keys: t
require-live-snap: 20 CURRENT GREETING CLAIM | current-trace
expect: data flow needs independent review
expect: tool-current-trace
expect: source unchanged
expect-not: EARLIER GREETING CLAIM
ask: Does Review clearly show only the authenticated last expansion, its source receipt and unverified claims, without upgrading the finding or starting work?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: trace-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: trace-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: trace-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: trace-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: trace-top-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: trace-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 20 CURRENT GREETING CLAIM | current-claim-40x12
expect-not: EARLIER GREETING CLAIM
ask: Can the operator page through the source receipt and its claim warning at every size, with local reading and back controls intact?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Viewing Review | back-to-reader
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/earlier-replay.txt
require-live-snap: 20 replay tool-earlier-trace | replay-command
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 EARLIER GREETING CLAIM | earlier-receipt
expect: tool-earlier-trace
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/trace_source_history.py inspected @TMP_TARGET @ART
ask: Is the earlier source receipt still independently readable in Replay without being merged into the latest trace?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/open-trace-finding.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 FINDING · Esc then Y | selected-after-restart
require-live-snap: 20 Viewing Review | review-reader-restarted
nav-mode:
keys: t
require-live-snap: 20 CURRENT GREETING CLAIM | recovered-trace
expect: data flow needs independent review
expect-not: EARLIER GREETING CLAIM
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/trace_source_history.py restart @TMP_TARGET @ART
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the exact latest trace, earlier receipts, source, active context and human decision with zero requests?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
